[[file:Curse Room Door.png]]

'''Curse Rooms''' feature teeth-like spikes on the door that hurt Isaac when entering and exiting the room.

Curse rooms can appear from [[Chapters|Chapter]] 1 to 5.

{{dlc|r}} Taking damage from the spikes doesn't reduce the odds of getting a Devil or Angel room.

== Layouts ==
The following room maps were made using [https://github.com/Basement-Renovator/basement-renovator Basement Renovator] for cleaner viewing.

